  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Managed Fund Technical Assistance Facility - Eastern Neighbourhood and Ukraine (TAF EP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to support the Government of Ukraine&apos;s Good governance and economic growth: primary responsibility to develop a detailed proposal and implementation plan, in line with Terms of Reference (ToR) and indicative budget. Following British Embassy Kyiv  approval, the TAF implementation team delivers the intervention as per agreed milestones, indicators, results, and objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
